  <name>Osier</name>
  <summary>Fast native git GUI</summary>
  <developer id="com.reyarlena">
    <name>Rey Arlena</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Osier is a native git client for Linux: visual staging down to single lines, a commit
      log with a graph, branches, stashes, worktrees, merge and rebase with in-place conflict
      resolution, patches and a patch clipboard, and multi-account GitHub authentication
      through the gh CLI. Every git command it runs is shown in a log.
    </p>
  </description>
